*.md
#   *.json             oxfmt escapes non-ASCII in JSON (— becomes \u2014); this repo's
#                      copy is Arabic-first, so JSON stays byte-identical
*.json
packages/db/drizzle/**
**/fixtures/**
.ci/**
pnpm-lock.yaml
